    "navTitle": "Assessment Design Notes",
    "content": "# Readiness Assessment Test (RAT): Data Normalization\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dkndq6lyz/image/upload/f_auto/q_auto/RAT_nqr5a3?_a=BAMAAAX00\" alt=\"RAT or Quiz section icon\" width=\"220\">\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n\n## Assessment Design Notes\n\nThis RAT supports readiness by testing whether students can reason with chapter concepts before class, focusing on structural reasoning rather than mere memorization.\n\n- Primary source base: [ch07-main-2026-06-16.md](../main/ch07-main-2026-06-16.md)\n- Secondary source base: [ch07-terms-2026-06-16.md](../terms/ch07-terms-2026-06-16.md)\n- Current Chapter 7 Lets-Build file: [ch07-lets-build-2026-06-16.md](../lets-build/ch07-lets-build-2026-06-16.md)\n- AI-resistance strategies used: chapter-specific grading-database references, dependency reasoning, scenario traps around anomalies and denormalization, multi-answer discrimination, migration and verification logic, and platform-specific Access notes.\n\n**Bloom Distribution**\n| Bloom Level | Target Count |\n| --- | ---: |\n| Remember | 8 |\n| Understand | 8 |\n| Apply | 8 |\n| Analyze | 8 |\n| Evaluate | 8 |\n\n**Design Criterion Coverage**\n| Design Criterion | Bloom Sections Used | Questions | Count |\n| --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n| Application-based | Apply, Analyze, Evaluate | 17-24, 25, 27, 30, 33-40 | 14 |\n| Scenario-based | Understand, Apply, Analyze, Evaluate | 10, 12, 14-16, 17-24, 25, 28, 30-40 | 12 |\n| Definition-only | Remember, Understand, Analyze | 1-9, 11, 13, 26, 29, 31-32 | 14 |",
