    "content": "# Chapter 10: Advanced SQL for Business Analysis\n\nTakes SQL from basic queries to sophisticated analysis using the full Grading Database. Covers data diagnostics, normalization through SQL, advanced JOINs, conditional functions, aggregation, date queries, weighted grades, window functions, reusable pipelines, safe data modification, and an integrated at-risk student report.\n\n## Chapter Files\n\n- [Main Chapter](ch10-main-2026-06-16.md)\n- [Let's Build](ch10-lets-build-2026-06-16.md)\n- [Review & Reflection](ch10-reflection-2026-06-16.md)\n- [Terms Treasury](ch10-terms-2026-06-16.md)\n- [Readiness Assessment Test](ch10-rat-2026-06-16.md)\n\n## Lab\n\n- [Lab 10 Questions](lab-10-questions-2026-06-16.md)",
